# Judge1-8-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"啊对了，<br>我想起来了。<br>我好像<link=\"Objection_01_01_08_01\">肚子饿了</link>，<br>然后去了<link=\"Objection_01_01_08_02\">食堂</link>。<br>唔，是这样吗？<br>或许是我<link=\"Objection_01_01_08_03\">记错</link>了。|#0101Trial08_Leia001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:呵呵，<br>真是饿肚子的话<br>就情有可原呢。|#0101Trial08_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,62 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:所以不管你怎么胡说八道，<br>我们只要相信就好咯？|#0101Trial08_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR4,ArmL6,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:抱歉了，我没有把大家<br>当傻子看的意思。<br>……可是，我们讨论这个<br>真的有意义吗？|#0101Trial08_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,62 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我也许<br>拿不出<br>不在场证明。<br>可是，你们不觉得<br>这件事小到<br>根本不值一提吗？|#0101Trial08_Leia003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:35,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"……毕竟，<br>我<link=\"Objection_01_01_08_04\">不会飞</link>。<br>诺亚离门口足足有3米远，<br>中间还<link=\"Objection_01_01_08_05\">有颜料挡着</link>，<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_08_06\">我根本没办法接近她</link>。|#0101Trial08_Leia004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:40,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL8,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……所以我觉得，<br>继续讨论这个话题根本没意义。<br>不如来讨论其他<br>更有建设意义的事，怎样？|#0101Trial08_Leia005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:40,55 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……有没有必要<br>继续讨论，<br>由我们来决定。<br>这件事至少你<br>没资格决定。|#0101Trial08_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,45 Roll:4

