[PrintTextModified Text:这……|#0101Trial08_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR5,ArmL3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:连我的个人感觉都要否定……<br>真让我伤心。<br>被关在这个地方我都没感到那么伤心。|#0101Trial08_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

