@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:倒不如说，食堂没人这件事<br>正好证明了我在食堂，你说对不对。|#0101Trial08_Leia010| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
